OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused says housemate
OL,4,A'threatened to kill him'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who later stabbed his
OL,7,Fhousemate to death was "terrified" by
OL,8,Fhis victim saying they were "looking
OL,9,Fforward to killing him", a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FZack Coughlan, 23, stabbed Jamie
OL,13,FCollins, 21, at their home in Bristol
OL,14,Fon 8 April. Coughlan admits
OL,15,Fresponsibility for the attack but
OL,16,Fdenies murder on the grounds he feared
OL,17,Ffor his life.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
