OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused says housemate
OL,4,A'threatened to kill him'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSobbing while giving evidence during
OL,7,Fhis trial at Bristol Crown Court, the
OL,8,Fdefendant told the jury Collins
OL,9,Finsisted he meant his threat the day
OL,10,Fafter making it, and said Coughlan
OL,11,Flocking his bedroom door "wasn't going
OL,12,Fto help".
OL,14,FLater that same day, Coughlan ambushed
OL,15,FCollins, stabbing him 30 times and
OL,16,Fleaving him for dead, only to call
OL,17,Fpolice eight hours later.
